      ],
      "en": "The order has come again."
    },
    {
      "start": 82.84,
      "end": 88.84,
      "lines": [
        "Ke watan-badar hon ham tum"
      ],
      "en": "You and I are to go into exile."
    },
    {
      "start": 88.84,
      "end": 95.24,
      "lines": [
        "Dein gali gali sadaein"
      ],
      "en": "We call out in street after street."
    },
    {
      "start": 95.24,
      "end": 100.68,
      "lines": [
        "Karein rukh nagar nagar ka"
      ],
      "en": "We make our way from town to town."
    },
    {
      "start": 100.68,
      "end": 106.76,
      "lines": [
        "Ke suragh koi paein"
      ],
      "en": "We hope to find some trace."
    },
    {
      "start": 106.76,
      "end": 115.72,
      "lines": [
        "Kisi yaar-e-nama-bar ka"
      ],
      "en": "Perhaps a friend might carry a letter."
    },
    {
      "start": 115.72,
      "end": 120.1,
      "lines": [
        "Har ik ajnabi se poochhein"
      ],
      "en": "We ask every stranger we meet."
    },
    {
      "start": 121.32,
      "end": 131.88,
      "lines": [
        "Jo pata tha apne ghar ka"
      ],
      "en": "Where was it we once called home?"
    },
    {
      "start": 148.08,
      "end": 154.0,
      "lines": [
        "Sar-e-ku-e-na-shanayan"
      ],
      "en": "The streets are full of strangers."
    },
    {
      "start": 154.0,
      "end": 159.6,
      "lines": [
        "Hamein din se raat karna"
      ],
      "en": "We pass the hours until nightfall."
    },
    {
      "start": 159.84,
      "end": 165.88,
      "lines": [
        "Kabhi is se baat karna"
      ],
      "en": "Now we speak to one."
    },
    {
      "start": 166.08,
      "end": 169.2,
      "lines": [
        "Kabhi us se baat karna"
      ],
      "en": "Now we speak to another."
    },
    {
      "start": 177.24,
      "end": 183.0,
      "lines": [
        "Tumhein kya kahoon ke kya hai"
      ],
      "en": "How can I tell you what it is like?"
    },
    {
      "start": 183.0,
      "end": 188.4,
      "lines": [
        "Shab-e-gham buri bala hai"
      ],
      "en": "The night of grief is hard to bear."
    },
    {
      "start": 188.4,
      "end": 194.92,
      "lines": [
        "Hamein yeh bhi tha ghanimat"
      ],
      "en": "Even this much would have been a mercy."
    },
    {
      "start": 194.92,
      "end": 200.6,
      "lines": [
        "Jo koi shumaar hota"
      ],
      "en": "If only it could be counted."
    },
    {
      "start": 200.68,
      "end": 206.8,
      "lines": [
        "Hamein kya bura tha marna"
      ],
      "en": "We would hardly have minded dying."
    },
    {
      "start": 206.8,
      "end": 213.8,
      "lines": [
        "Agar ek baar hota"
      ],
      "en": "If only we had to die once."
    },
